  "body": "The options object as the first argument to the constructor is annoying, since it makes it non-optional. (Or if we did make it optional, you'd do `new ReadableStream(undefined, (...) => ...)`, which isn't exactly pretty.) But putting it _after_ the function parameter seems even worse.\n\nWe could do overloading, but... meh...\n",
